    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i dont think there's anyone to find. it just feels like the house is empty anyway. why bother trying to fix the wiring or anything when the rooms are already gone? it feels more peaceful to just... let the last light go out before it gets too scary in the dark.",
