    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being still though. it's more like... if i'm just waiting for the lights to go out, im still stuck in the house. i'm talking about just making the choice. why wait for the slow decay when i could just reach for the switch? it seems almost more dignified to end it on my own terms while there's still a tiny bit of me left to know what i'm doing.",
